      "title": "Cargo Cult Science",
      "gist": "Real science demands bending over backwards to show how you might be wrong; fields that skip this only imitate science.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — why does imitating the forms of science fail without strict honesty about your own errors? (a speech)",
      "sourceHeading": "Cargo Cult Science"
