      "title": "A Not-So-Scientific World",
      "gist": "Beliefs like mysticism, ESP, and failing education and crime theories show that people still trust remedies that do not work, and pseudoscience intimidates ordinary common sense.",
      "question": "Pseudoscience — why do so many people still believe things that do not work? (a personal tour)"
    },
    "n0008": {
      "id": "n0008",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0007",
