      "range": [
        "spya-ddrr9m",
        "spya-bcgpc3"
      ],
      "title": "From Witch Doctors to Science",
      "gist": "Science grew from testing ideas and dropping those that fail, yet many people today still believe in UFOs, astrology and mysticism, so it is not truly a scientific world."
    },
