      "title": "Cargo Cult Science Defined",
      "gist": "Like islanders building imitation runways and waiting for planes, some fields copy the forms of science yet miss the essential honesty that makes it work.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — what essential thing is missing from fields that only look scientific? (an analogy and a principle)"
    },
    "n0023": {
      "id": "n0023",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0022",
