      "range": [
        "spya-fd2muf",
        "spya-fd2muf"
      ],
      "title": "The Cargo Cult Analogy",
      "gist": "South Sea islanders rebuilt runways and a wooden control hut with perfect form, but no planes landed, just as work that copies scientific form still fails."
    },
    "n0024": {
