      "title": "Not Fooling Yourself",
      "gist": "The first principle is not to fool yourself, as Millikan's electron-charge history shows, and scientists also owe honesty to laymen and to those who use their advice.",
      "question": "Self-deception — how can scientists avoid fooling themselves and others? (examples and a principle)"
    },
